\begin{slide}
CT I Kalman Filter Software Architecture Overview
\begin{itemize}
  \item Primary Kalman Cycle: Every 10 sec or .1 Hz
  \item Secondary Kalman Subcycles: 1 Hz and 4 Hz
  \item Third Tier Kalman Subcycle: 8 Hz
  \item Fourth Tier Kalman Minor Cycle: 16 Hz
\end{itemize} 
\end{slide}

\begin{slide}
CT I Kalman Filter Software Architecture Overview
\begin{itemize}
  \item Highly intertwined with general navigation calculations
  \item Some of the same utilities are called at various rates
\end{itemize} 
\end{slide}
